(4438227, 638868, 19670, '<td valign="top">I like the thumbnail, but sorry about the DQ, as no text may be added to submissions. Also, is this 640 pixels tall? It looks like it''s smaller than that.</td>', 'I like the thumbnail, but sorry about the DQ, as no text may be added to submissions. Also, is this 640 pixels tall? It looks like it''s smaller than that.', '2008-01-30 00:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
