(4438233, 639459, 87538, '<td valign="top">I can see a bit of fringing around the ironwork...however, the shot really captured and held my eyes. 9</td>', 'I can see a bit of fringing around the ironwork...however, the shot really captured and held my eyes. 9', '2008-01-30 00:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
