(4438248, 640076, 87538, '<td valign="top">Does the tilt really lend a stronger effect?  I don''t think so. You took a possible 9 and turned it into a 5.</td>', 'Does the tilt really lend a stronger effect?  I don''t think so. You took a possible 9 and turned it into a 5.', '2008-01-30 00:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438256, 639025, 19245, '<td valign="top">props for creativity!</td>', 'props for creativity!', '2008-01-30 00:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438262, 639477, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the composition. I like the repeated lines of the columns, and it seem to fit the challenge well. Perhaps it was your intention, but the saturation is very intense. Too intense for my taste.</td>', 'I like the subject and the composition. I like the repeated lines of the columns, and it seem to fit the challenge well. Perhaps it was your intention, but the saturation is very intense. Too intense for my taste.', '2008-01-30 00:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438269, 638554, 19245, '<td valign="top">I''ve been there! nice!</td>', 'I''ve been there! nice!', '2008-01-30 00:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438275, 639708, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject. I like your choice of lens and the perspective from which you took the photo. I may be wrong but it feels like an experiment in HDR that''s gone a bit too far.</td>', 'Beautiful subject. I like your choice of lens and the perspective from which you took the photo. I may be wrong but it feels like an experiment in HDR that''s gone a bit too far.', '2008-01-30 00:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438279, 639212, 18197, '<td valign="top">Firenze, one of my favorite cities. I have stood on this exact spot and taken this exact photo, although yours turned out a bit better than mine. Good luck inthe voting.</td>', 'Firenze, one of my favorite cities. I have stood on this exact spot and taken this exact photo, although yours turned out a bit better than mine. Good luck inthe voting.', '2008-01-30 00:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438280, 639637, 87538, '<td valign="top">Your editing confuses me.<br/>If you didn''t like the right hand portion of the image, why not just crop it out. In the process of whatever you did, you blurred the lower right hand portion of the barn.  I was ready to vote a 9....now...6, but that is generous in my opinion. You just went to far with the editing process.</td>', 'Your editing confuses me.If you didn''t like the right hand portion of the image, why not just crop it out. In the process of whatever you did, you blurred the lower right hand portion of the barn.  I was ready to vote a 9....now...6, but that is generous in my opinion. You just went to far with the editing process.', '2008-01-30 00:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438284, 639025, 87538, '<td valign="top">This was going to be my daughter''s submission. Thought it was an excellent idea.  9</td>', 'This was going to be my daughter''s submission. Thought it was an excellent idea.  9', '2008-01-30 00:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438288, 638868, 80859, '<td valign="top">i love this, but i think you''re gonna be dq''d for having added text.  i would have scored it very high.</td>', 'i love this, but i think you''re gonna be dq''d for having added text.  i would have scored it very high.', '2008-01-30 00:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438293, 639090, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great subject. Nice composition. I''m wondering where it is? I may be incorrect but it feels like you were trying for an HDR feeling, hopefully from a single image, but that you went a little bit too far. Still a pleasing photo.</td>', 'Great subject. Nice composition. I''m wondering where it is? I may be incorrect but it feels like you were trying for an HDR feeling, hopefully from a single image, but that you went a little bit too far. Still a pleasing photo.', '2008-01-30 00:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
