(4438318, 637816, 87538, '<td valign="top">I wish you had not overdone the sharpening or USM. The guide wires are pixelated even at this reduced size. The concrete supports also have jagged edges instead of appearing smooth. Sorry to say, but you took a 9 or 10  down to a 5.</td>', 'I wish you had not overdone the sharpening or USM. The guide wires are pixelated even at this reduced size. The concrete supports also have jagged edges instead of appearing smooth. Sorry to say, but you took a 9 or 10  down to a 5.', '2008-01-30 01:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
