(4438388, 639504, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a fine abstract. I can easily see it in a magazine as a background for an advertizement. It would complement the right sort of text over the top of the image. But here, in this challenge, I fear it will suffer in the voting.</td>', 'This is a fine abstract. I can easily see it in a magazine as a background for an advertizement. It would complement the right sort of text over the top of the image. But here, in this challenge, I fear it will suffer in the voting.', '2008-01-30 01:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
