(4440489, 638006, 77838, '<td valign="top">The sky feels a little blown out.  Maybe using a Neutral Density filter you could have retained a little detail/color.  Sorry to keep picking your photo apart but I would''ve liked to seen the image rotated just a smidgen to the right also.  I''m guessing that the ridges might have ran at an angle but that was just my first impression (to get them more vertical).  Overall, it is a great picture. -BB</td>', 'The sky feels a little blown out.  Maybe using a Neutral Density filter you could have retained a little detail/color.  Sorry to keep picking your photo apart but I would''ve liked to seen the image rotated just a smidgen to the right also.  I''m guessing that the ridges might have ran at an angle but that was just my first impression (to get them more vertical).  Overall, it is a great picture. -BB', '2008-01-30 14:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440495, 638493, 77838, '<td valign="top">It feels like your contrast might be a bit much for me.  You have really deep shadows and the faces of the rocks/brick are almost blown out on some of them. Nice framing with the arches though. -BB</td>', 'It feels like your contrast might be a bit much for me.  You have really deep shadows and the faces of the rocks/brick are almost blown out on some of them. Nice framing with the arches though. -BB', '2008-01-30 14:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440509, 637903, 77838, '<td valign="top">The only wish that I have would be to darken the hot spot of the statue at the bottom of the picture.</td>', 'The only wish that I have would be to darken the hot spot of the statue at the bottom of the picture.', '2008-01-30 14:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
