(4440958, 639332, 89277, '<td valign="top">I like the combination of b&amp;w with old arches, they complement each other very well. Also, I like the detail on the arches. I''m not really in love with the sky and the sharpness sort of looks funky, but other than that great shot.</td>', 'I like the combination of b&w with old arches, they complement each other very well. Also, I like the detail on the arches. I''m not really in love with the sky and the sharpness sort of looks funky, but other than that great shot.', '2008-01-30 17:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440961, 639341, 50804, '<td valign="top">Wow, neat capture!  I can''t decide if I like the woman''s uneasy stance on the steps ... someone walking down more gracefully would have looked nice, but at the same time this woman accentuates the precarious feeling of so many half-height steps.</td>', 'Wow, neat capture!  I can''t decide if I like the woman''s uneasy stance on the steps ... someone walking down more gracefully would have looked nice, but at the same time this woman accentuates the precarious feeling of so many half-height steps.', '2008-01-30 17:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
