(4441092, 639025, 80912, '<td valign="top">Well, no one said it had to be a picture of the actual "thing" that was built. lol It has interesting composition and it''s well shot, plus iot doesn''t look like anything else in the challenge!</td>', 'Well, no one said it had to be a picture of the actual "thing" that was built. lol It has interesting composition and it''s well shot, plus iot doesn''t look like anything else in the challenge!', '2008-01-30 17:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
