(4441098, 639821, 86447, '<td valign="top">It appears a bit tilted to me...(to the left a tad)</td>', 'It appears a bit tilted to me...(to the left a tad)', '2008-01-30 17:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441101, 640046, 50804, '<td valign="top">I wish the monolithic buildings in the background weren''t there so I could focus on the triangles in the railway elements next to the triangular cantilever in the building on the right.</td>', 'I wish the monolithic buildings in the background weren''t there so I could focus on the triangles in the railway elements next to the triangular cantilever in the building on the right.', '2008-01-30 17:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441104, 639860, 52500, '<td valign="top">I know you''re getting slammed for it already, but I can''t condone the inclusion of the datestamp either.</td>', 'I know you''re getting slammed for it already, but I can''t condone the inclusion of the datestamp either.', '2008-01-30 17:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441105, 639625, 50804, '<td valign="top">My eyes can''t quite figure out what to look at in this photo.  They''re drawn first to the white triangles (negative space) and next to the two yellow poles that end in the center.  Hmm...</td>', 'My eyes can''t quite figure out what to look at in this photo.  They''re drawn first to the white triangles (negative space) and next to the two yellow poles that end in the center.  Hmm...', '2008-01-30 17:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441115, 639490, 50804, '<td valign="top">Almost seems cruel that they gave us an Architecture challenge with Basic editing so we can''t correct the perspective.  Good exposure on this though.</td>', 'Almost seems cruel that they gave us an Architecture challenge with Basic editing so we can''t correct the perspective.  Good exposure on this though.', '2008-01-30 17:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441123, 638118, 50804, '<td valign="top">Captured the light nicely. Unfortunate that the perspective tilt is so extreme.</td>', 'Captured the light nicely. Unfortunate that the perspective tilt is so extreme.', '2008-01-30 17:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441128, 639783, 50804, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems flat, but nice the way you completely isolated it from any background.</td>', 'Lighting seems flat, but nice the way you completely isolated it from any background.', '2008-01-30 17:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441160, 637896, 52500, '<td valign="top">I love the point of view and the overall feel, but it''s lacking in a few key areas for me.  First, I would crank the contrast <i>way</i> up.  Second, add some black to the blacks in selective color to make the sky an almost pure black.  This would also fix what appear to be spots of goo on your sensor (or you could close those out).  As is, I''ll give it a 7.  With those processing changes, I would probably give it a 9.</td>', 'I love the point of view and the overall feel, but it''s lacking in a few key areas for me.  First, I would crank the contrast way up.  Second, add some black to the blacks in selective color to make the sky an almost pure black.  This would also fix what appear to be spots of goo on your sensor (or you could close those out).  As is, I''ll give it a 7.  With those processing changes, I would probably give it a 9.', '2008-01-30 17:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441186, 639637, 5364, '<td valign="top">The background is too distracting for me which is a pity because the shack is very good.</td>', 'The background is too distracting for me which is a pity because the shack is very good.', '2008-01-30 18:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441219, 638168, 50804, '<td valign="top">Nice texture -- I can almost feel the side of the building.</td>', 'Nice texture -- I can almost feel the side of the building.', '2008-01-30 18:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441226, 639988, 50804, '<td valign="top">Appears the focus (literally) was on the tree rather than the architecture ... especially unfortunate since the duotone or desat treatment makes the tree look dead.</td>', 'Appears the focus (literally) was on the tree rather than the architecture ... especially unfortunate since the duotone or desat treatment makes the tree look dead.', '2008-01-30 18:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441230, 639980, 50804, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and shapes and colors!</td>', 'Nice lines and shapes and colors!', '2008-01-30 18:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441248, 637896, 50804, '<td valign="top">Wow -- excellent way to use composition to mitigate the perspective on these buildings! 9</td>', 'Wow -- excellent way to use composition to mitigate the perspective on these buildings! 9', '2008-01-30 18:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441263, 637831, 50804, '<td valign="top">I love this place every time I see it!  Interesting that you chose to flip it -- I do think the sharper lines at the bottom lead the eye into the picture better, but at the same time I''m practically standing on my head because I want to see it as I would experience it in real life. :)</td>', 'I love this place every time I see it!  Interesting that you chose to flip it -- I do think the sharper lines at the bottom lead the eye into the picture better, but at the same time I''m practically standing on my head because I want to see it as I would experience it in real life. :)', '2008-01-30 18:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441266, 638419, 50804, '<td valign="top">The perspective works well in this case.</td>', 'The perspective works well in this case.', '2008-01-30 18:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441282, 638917, 50804, '<td valign="top">Creates an interesting atmosphere.  I might have desaturated the blue-green range to get rid of that color shift around the skyscraper at the expense of less color in the glass windows.</td>', 'Creates an interesting atmosphere.  I might have desaturated the blue-green range to get rid of that color shift around the skyscraper at the expense of less color in the glass windows.', '2008-01-30 18:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441292, 639969, 50804, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes -- the oblique lines of the building help downplay the perspective.  The tonal range seems flat, or maybe it''s just the sky not setting the building off enough.</td>', 'Nice shapes -- the oblique lines of the building help downplay the perspective.  The tonal range seems flat, or maybe it''s just the sky not setting the building off enough.', '2008-01-30 18:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441301, 638217, 88704, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.', '2008-01-30 18:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441302, 637892, 50804, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and colors, though seems a bit soft.  Darn cranes...</td>', 'Great lighting and colors, though seems a bit soft.  Darn cranes...', '2008-01-30 18:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441311, 639429, 50804, '<td valign="top">Cool ... symmetry and isolation really work when dealing with this much perspective!  A building this tall pretty much has to be in the center to avoid looking like a certain tower in Pisa.</td>', 'Cool ... symmetry and isolation really work when dealing with this much perspective!  A building this tall pretty much has to be in the center to avoid looking like a certain tower in Pisa.', '2008-01-30 18:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441314, 639624, 50804, '<td valign="top">Filling the frame really works here.  Great, soft colors!</td>', 'Filling the frame really works here.  Great, soft colors!', '2008-01-30 18:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441328, 639579, 50804, '<td valign="top">For me, the light globe actually hurts this composition -- on one hand it fills in the corner and creates more consistent breathing space around the building, but on the other hand the rounded line detracts from the stark, straight lines.</td>', 'For me, the light globe actually hurts this composition -- on one hand it fills in the corner and creates more consistent breathing space around the building, but on the other hand the rounded line detracts from the stark, straight lines.', '2008-01-30 18:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441345, 639962, 67258, '<td valign="top">One of two 10s I have given in this challenge.  The enormous depth of field is seriously impressive.</td>', 'One of two 10s I have given in this challenge.  The enormous depth of field is seriously impressive.', '2008-01-30 18:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441348, 639993, 50804, '<td valign="top">I think there is so much interesting architecture on that building that you could have gone closer and left out the uninteresting smokestack and dead-end walkway.  It feels busy yet there''s so much negative space.</td>', 'I think there is so much interesting architecture on that building that you could have gone closer and left out the uninteresting smokestack and dead-end walkway.  It feels busy yet there''s so much negative space.', '2008-01-30 18:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441352, 639317, 50804, '<td valign="top">Very simple... beautiful sky... and you used the perspective to your advantage.</td>', 'Very simple... beautiful sky... and you used the perspective to your advantage.', '2008-01-30 18:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441363, 639649, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty good composition of an interesting scene, but the horrible compression artifacts really detract!  If you are a new member and need advice on uploading future entries, drop me a PM.</td>', 'This is a pretty good composition of an interesting scene, but the horrible compression artifacts really detract!  If you are a new member and need advice on uploading future entries, drop me a PM.', '2008-01-30 18:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441368, 639025, 50804, '<td valign="top">Nice!  And thinking outside the box.  While I like the high-contrast B&amp;W, I almost want to see a little color in the coffee and/or a bright colored mug.</td>', 'Nice!  And thinking outside the box.  While I like the high-contrast B&W, I almost want to see a little color in the coffee and/or a bright colored mug.', '2008-01-30 18:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441381, 639130, 50804, '<td valign="top">I think I see what you were aiming for here ... an interesting perspective rather than overt architecture?  Might be better with deeper DOF.</td>', 'I think I see what you were aiming for here ... an interesting perspective rather than overt architecture?  Might be better with deeper DOF.', '2008-01-30 19:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441400, 639738, 50804, '<td valign="top">Beautiful building ... too bad they stuck a missile nosecone right in front of it. :)  Seems like you should have stepped about a meter to your right to get it perfectly centered.</td>', 'Beautiful building ... too bad they stuck a missile nosecone right in front of it. :)  Seems like you should have stepped about a meter to your right to get it perfectly centered.', '2008-01-30 19:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441420, 639481, 50804, '<td valign="top">Slightly bright in the top center, seems like a tad less exposure would have helped control the highlights and the shadow areas are as interesting anyway.  Symmetry is just a tad bit off, but pretty good. 7</td>', 'Slightly bright in the top center, seems like a tad less exposure would have helped control the highlights and the shadow areas are as interesting anyway.  Symmetry is just a tad bit off, but pretty good. 7', '2008-01-30 19:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441425, 637574, 50804, '<td valign="top">The tint you chose doesn''t do anything for me, but the lines and lighting on the buildings is really good.</td>', 'The tint you chose doesn''t do anything for me, but the lines and lighting on the buildings is really good.', '2008-01-30 19:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441452, 639652, 50804, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the trees get in the way -- you would have done better to move closer and isolate some of the details on the facade.</td>', 'Unfortunately the trees get in the way -- you would have done better to move closer and isolate some of the details on the facade.', '2008-01-30 19:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
