(4443605, 638647, 50804, '<td valign="top">This works pretty well ... I''m wondering how you managed to blow out the sky enough to make it solid white ... maybe with the help of channel mixer? (sorry,  thinking out loud again!)</td>', 'This works pretty well ... I''m wondering how you managed to blow out the sky enough to make it solid white ... maybe with the help of channel mixer? (sorry,  thinking out loud again!)', '2008-01-31 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
