(4443704, 638083, 35044, '<td valign="top">I really like this - would be in my top 5 if it had a touch more contrast (in lightroom I would raise the black point).</td>', 'I really like this - would be in my top 5 if it had a touch more contrast (in lightroom I would raise the black point).', '2008-01-31 14:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
