(4444474, 639741, 73235, '<td valign="top">well exposeed capture with good DOF and saturation and details. the composition is well thought through. congrats to a very nice pic</td>', 'well exposeed capture with good DOF and saturation and details. the composition is well thought through. congrats to a very nice pic', '2008-01-31 20:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444503, 637387, 73235, '<td valign="top">Here is my first impression, so pleas take it as just that. For me it looks like a handheld picture taken out of a sense of "I have to take this picture". You probably took it handheld without stabilizing support. Now I''m guesiing: you did not explore whether there might be some interesting angles to see? Did you get really close and looked up? Did you walk around and checked the different oppoertunities for reflections, angles, lines, ineractions between relactions from outside with a view into the inside?</td>', 'Here is my first impression, so pleas take it as just that. For me it looks like a handheld picture taken out of a sense of "I have to take this picture". You probably took it handheld without stabilizing support. Now I''m guesiing: you did not explore whether there might be some interesting angles to see? Did you get really close and looked up? Did you walk around and checked the different oppoertunities for reflections, angles, lines, ineractions between relactions from outside with a view into the inside?', '2008-01-31 20:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444505, 637904, 73235, '<td valign="top">very appealing play of colors. well exposed in spite of the bright sun light. good details.</td>', 'very appealing play of colors. well exposed in spite of the bright sun light. good details.', '2008-01-31 20:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444526, 639656, 23484, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. The distorted perspective works well with the angle.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. The distorted perspective works well with the angle.', '2008-01-31 20:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444531, 639441, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Great contrast between the two.</td>', 'Very nicely done. Great contrast between the two.', '2008-01-31 20:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444663, 639363, 88756, '<td valign="top">Huge!</td>', 'Huge!', '2008-01-31 22:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444703, 637816, 71990, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2008-01-31 22:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444751, 639481, 73235, '<td valign="top">I like your composition for 2 main reasons: nicely balanced and symetrical, the secon part is the discribution of light: bright in the center and then getting darker to the outside.</td>', 'I like your composition for 2 main reasons: nicely balanced and symetrical, the secon part is the discribution of light: bright in the center and then getting darker to the outside.', '2008-01-31 22:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444763, 639074, 71990, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but would have loved a more abstract look, no person, and more tonal variations, DOF is optimal IMHO</td>', 'Nice idea, but would have loved a more abstract look, no person, and more tonal variations, DOF is optimal IMHO', '2008-01-31 22:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444768, 638844, 71990, '<td valign="top">Would have liked a sharper picture, nice composition though, congrats</td>', 'Would have liked a sharper picture, nice composition though, congrats', '2008-01-31 22:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444782, 639761, 73235, '<td valign="top">It''s very hard for me to find the right words. So please take it as my impression, what I see in your shot. Although you have real strong colors and an interesting object, I don''t receive what you tried to accomplish. If it''s for the colors, then there is too much black and darkness in your picture. If it''s about composition, it''s neither centered, nor symetrical. If it''s about lines, there are too many interruptions , e.g. in the reflection of the arc, the line of light covered by the trees. I''m not sure that the position you took the picture is the best one to show off this bridge in its beauty. You might consider going back and reshooting, e.g. showing the traffic over the bridge and framing the traffic with the bridge. Having the arc crossing diagonally through the picture, something unusual about the bridge, not just as it spanns the river. Just some initial thoughts looking at your picture.</td>', 'It''s very hard for me to find the right words. So please take it as my impression, what I see in your shot. Although you have real strong colors and an interesting object, I don''t receive what you tried to accomplish. If it''s for the colors, then there is too much black and darkness in your picture. If it''s about composition, it''s neither centered, nor symetrical. If it''s about lines, there are too many interruptions , e.g. in the reflection of the arc, the line of light covered by the trees. I''m not sure that the position you took the picture is the best one to show off this bridge in its beauty. You might consider going back and reshooting, e.g. showing the traffic over the bridge and framing the traffic with the bridge. Having the arc crossing diagonally through the picture, something unusual about the bridge, not just as it spanns the river. Just some initial thoughts looking at your picture.', '2008-01-31 22:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444784, 639328, 89223, '<td valign="top">i love the Perspective in this photo, great shot!</td>', 'i love the Perspective in this photo, great shot!', '2008-01-31 22:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444785, 639935, 89223, '<td valign="top">great shot, the colors are beautiful</td>', 'great shot, the colors are beautiful', '2008-01-31 22:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444786, 639801, 89223, '<td valign="top">wow thats amazing! it just boggles my mind. great job</td>', 'wow thats amazing! it just boggles my mind. great job', '2008-01-31 22:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4445390, 639720, 89595, '<td valign="top">I think a little more contrast between the buildings and the sky could have been very nice here</td>', 'I think a little more contrast between the buildings and the sky could have been very nice here', '2008-02-01 03:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
