(4445981, 637896, 19670, '<td valign="top">Nice angle. Are those spots sensor dust, or lens flares? Or something else?<br/>The curved building looks overexposed in the center of the shot, and a little blurry.</td>', 'Nice angle. Are those spots sensor dust, or lens flares? Or something else?The curved building looks overexposed in the center of the shot, and a little blurry.', '2008-02-01 09:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4445986, 638753, 19670, '<td valign="top">Has a nostalgic postcard look to it.</td>', 'Has a nostalgic postcard look to it.', '2008-02-01 09:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4445990, 639574, 19670, '<td valign="top">The subject here seems to be much more the bird(s) than the architecture.</td>', 'The subject here seems to be much more the bird(s) than the architecture.', '2008-02-01 09:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446008, 637811, 19670, '<td valign="top">The black bars at top and bottom are distracting, make it look like a mistake. They also made me notice the thin bars on the sides. I''d suggest a more intentional-looking border, if indeed you did do that on purpose.</td>', 'The black bars at top and bottom are distracting, make it look like a mistake. They also made me notice the thin bars on the sides. I''d suggest a more intentional-looking border, if indeed you did do that on purpose.', '2008-02-01 09:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
