(4446225, 639441, 81669, '<td valign="top">Awesome! A definite eleven. But you''ll have to settle for a 10, I guess. The color, detail and light quality is just wonderful!!</td>', 'Awesome! A definite eleven. But you''ll have to settle for a 10, I guess. The color, detail and light quality is just wonderful!!', '2008-02-01 10:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
