(4446820, 639411, 9478, '<td valign="top">Perfect simetry, good light and detail.</td>', 'Perfect simetry, good light and detail.', '2008-02-01 13:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446826, 639945, 9478, '<td valign="top">Very original, I do like it. The dome has very good light and clouds are vry expressive. Perfect combination.</td>', 'Very original, I do like it. The dome has very good light and clouds are vry expressive. Perfect combination.', '2008-02-01 13:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446851, 639546, 9478, '<td valign="top">I like the rhythm created by the different sizes and position of the windows and the perpendidular lines on the wall. The space is well divided by lines.</td>', 'I like the rhythm created by the different sizes and position of the windows and the perpendidular lines on the wall. The space is well divided by lines.', '2008-02-01 13:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446853, 639808, 73235, '<td valign="top">lovely centered and mirrored display. most photogs would have taken the shot earlier with no shadows on the castle, but I like the beak up of the wall by the shadow.</td>', 'lovely centered and mirrored display. most photogs would have taken the shot earlier with no shadows on the castle, but I like the beak up of the wall by the shadow.', '2008-02-01 13:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446862, 639962, 9478, '<td valign="top">Spectacular definition, light and darkness. Very good composition. One of my favourites.</td>', 'Spectacular definition, light and darkness. Very good composition. One of my favourites.', '2008-02-01 13:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446866, 639317, 9478, '<td valign="top">Simple but powerful. Nice colour combination.</td>', 'Simple but powerful. Nice colour combination.', '2008-02-01 13:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446870, 639835, 73235, '<td valign="top">I can''t say I like the subject too much, but I like your capture regarding exposure, DOF, sharpness. Even hiding the details of the horizon by brightening up the area adds an interesting touch.</td>', 'I can''t say I like the subject too much, but I like your capture regarding exposure, DOF, sharpness. Even hiding the details of the horizon by brightening up the area adds an interesting touch.', '2008-02-01 13:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446872, 639441, 9478, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing how you got such a combination of colours, a so well focused image in every corner of the picture. Very good composition also.</td>', 'It''s amazing how you got such a combination of colours, a so well focused image in every corner of the picture. Very good composition also.', '2008-02-01 13:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446877, 637904, 9478, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus, the inclination gives it strenght. Good colour combination.</td>', 'Excellent focus, the inclination gives it strenght. Good colour combination.', '2008-02-01 13:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446879, 638014, 9478, '<td valign="top">Perfectly cropped, good subject and shot.</td>', 'Perfectly cropped, good subject and shot.', '2008-02-01 13:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446899, 638339, 73235, '<td valign="top">the contrast in your picture is the factor that brings it to life.</td>', 'the contrast in your picture is the factor that brings it to life.', '2008-02-01 13:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446908, 638528, 73235, '<td valign="top">good timing of your exposure. you could capture one car with its motion blur. I have to admit this is the one part of your picture that caught my eye.</td>', 'good timing of your exposure. you could capture one car with its motion blur. I have to admit this is the one part of your picture that caught my eye.', '2008-02-01 13:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446911, 639561, 73235, '<td valign="top">I like the timing of your picture: tha sky is not black but has some interesting colors and cloud features. excellent night shot.</td>', 'I like the timing of your picture: tha sky is not black but has some interesting colors and cloud features. excellent night shot.', '2008-02-01 13:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446932, 639598, 73235, '<td valign="top">I believe getting closer or cropping closer could enhance your picture.the branches on the left and right are not really adding anything. on the other side - I like the reflection of the trees in the windows, gives it some nice depth. somehow a bright halo creepted into your pic. I don''t think it comes from oversharpening as the branches don''t have the halo.</td>', 'I believe getting closer or cropping closer could enhance your picture.the branches on the left and right are not really adding anything. on the other side - I like the reflection of the trees in the windows, gives it some nice depth. somehow a bright halo creepted into your pic. I don''t think it comes from oversharpening as the branches don''t have the halo.', '2008-02-01 13:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446938, 640068, 73235, '<td valign="top">the title exactly describes what your picture lives from. well balanced exposure .</td>', 'the title exactly describes what your picture lives from. well balanced exposure .', '2008-02-01 13:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446943, 639779, 73235, '<td valign="top">good job controlling the exposure in the nicely centered composition.</td>', 'good job controlling the exposure in the nicely centered composition.', '2008-02-01 13:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446956, 639656, 73235, '<td valign="top">this stands out due to its off centered off ballanced composition. so many pictures show the centered frontal view. nive fresh POV</td>', 'this stands out due to its off centered off ballanced composition. so many pictures show the centered frontal view. nive fresh POV', '2008-02-01 13:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4447005, 637867, 73235, '<td valign="top">I like this shot for it''s warm tones and the details in the windows.</td>', 'I like this shot for it''s warm tones and the details in the windows.', '2008-02-01 14:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4447013, 639915, 73235, '<td valign="top">good symetry. tough picture to take as there are different color tmeperatures in the lights. You did well.</td>', 'good symetry. tough picture to take as there are different color tmeperatures in the lights. You did well.', '2008-02-01 14:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
