(4447909, 638443, 57777, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool, very intense shot! Looks like big brother, and a 1984 book scene. I love it! GREAT work!</td>', 'This is a very cool, very intense shot! Looks like big brother, and a 1984 book scene. I love it! GREAT work!', '2008-02-01 16:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
