(4447925, 637894, 57777, '<td valign="top">seems washed out and a bit to light. a longer exposure to help the river would have also made a difference. Look into ND filters! Looks like a great place to shoot!</td>', 'seems washed out and a bit to light. a longer exposure to help the river would have also made a difference. Look into ND filters! Looks like a great place to shoot!', '2008-02-01 16:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
