(4451245, 639575, 28029, '<td valign="top">Coulda'' been great. I know one has to take the pic that is there sometimes, not the one we wish were there, but the sunset throws the pic into chaos. Maybe not chaos but the eye does not know where to go.The pic might have been better even without the sunset. A bridge silhouette may have been great alone (I am assuming you could not change your angle to the sunset). I don''t know. The other compositional issue could be that the pic is virtually cut in half even considering the angle. Still I like it.8</td>', 'Coulda'' been great. I know one has to take the pic that is there sometimes, not the one we wish were there, but the sunset throws the pic into chaos. Maybe not chaos but the eye does not know where to go.The pic might have been better even without the sunset. A bridge silhouette may have been great alone (I am assuming you could not change your angle to the sunset). I don''t know. The other compositional issue could be that the pic is virtually cut in half even considering the angle. Still I like it.8', '2008-02-02 16:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
