(4451846, 639602, 65234, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots that makes my jaw drop.  The shapes are striking even before my brain interprets all that I''m seeing, and then I''m amazed at the symmetry.  Perfect POV, absolutely perfect.  Just enough detail on the exposure.  Slight noisiness but I don''t care.  I''m in awe of all the things done so very well.</td>', 'This is one of those shots that makes my jaw drop.  The shapes are striking even before my brain interprets all that I''m seeing, and then I''m amazed at the symmetry.  Perfect POV, absolutely perfect.  Just enough detail on the exposure.  Slight noisiness but I don''t care.  I''m in awe of all the things done so very well.', '2008-02-02 19:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451847, 639806, 43774, '<td valign="top">A big empty stadium, very cool, not somethng we see often in photos.</td>', 'A big empty stadium, very cool, not somethng we see often in photos.', '2008-02-02 19:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
