(4458293, 640027, 57777, '<td valign="top">very nice lighting and texture, and a very cool building. I think that backing off just a hair, and letting the sides of the tower come into the frame a bit more may have helped</td>', 'very nice lighting and texture, and a very cool building. I think that backing off just a hair, and letting the sides of the tower come into the frame a bit more may have helped', '2008-02-04 19:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
