(4458312, 639821, 57777, '<td valign="top">This building, especially the top, has some VERY cool design artifacts to it, but I think that this is to standard of an angle. Get in closer, do some cropping, and bring some of that detail out. Great choice of a building, and nice exposure</td>', 'This building, especially the top, has some VERY cool design artifacts to it, but I think that this is to standard of an angle. Get in closer, do some cropping, and bring some of that detail out. Great choice of a building, and nice exposure', '2008-02-04 19:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
