(4458360, 639546, 57777, '<td valign="top">I would try a totally different approach to this shot. IMHO, the most fascinating part of this building are the old windows in the brown section with the white shades, and the cool old wood around them. I think that zooming in on those, turning it to black and white, and really playing with the contrast and levels of this photo would have brought out some cool detail in the wood. Right now, its to straight on.</td>', 'I would try a totally different approach to this shot. IMHO, the most fascinating part of this building are the old windows in the brown section with the white shades, and the cool old wood around them. I think that zooming in on those, turning it to black and white, and really playing with the contrast and levels of this photo would have brought out some cool detail in the wood. Right now, its to straight on.', '2008-02-04 19:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4458362, 638168, 57777, '<td valign="top">Cool location and lamp. I think shooting this at night when the lamp is on would have been great!</td>', 'Cool location and lamp. I think shooting this at night when the lamp is on would have been great!', '2008-02-04 19:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
