(4458935, 639218, 57777, '<td valign="top">The exposure really brings out the stone work on this, which is very nice. Good color, contrast and everything. The problem is that my eye wanders because there is not that main, great thing to catch it. Good photo, but maybe a different angle would provide the final touch it needs</td>', 'The exposure really brings out the stone work on this, which is very nice. Good color, contrast and everything. The problem is that my eye wanders because there is not that main, great thing to catch it. Good photo, but maybe a different angle would provide the final touch it needs', '2008-02-04 22:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4458941, 638917, 57777, '<td valign="top">good concept. Problem here is that there is so much white. Also, I think things need a bit more saturation anyway. Like I said, great concept, just needed a bit more on the execution</td>', 'good concept. Problem here is that there is so much white. Also, I think things need a bit more saturation anyway. Like I said, great concept, just needed a bit more on the execution', '2008-02-04 22:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4458975, 638818, 57777, '<td valign="top">Great view of seattle! Seems a little overexposed on the right, and perhaps just a little fuzzy/too noisy on the left. Suprised you got this close and this shot with security. Ive tried to get here before and definately got turned away. Its really very nice, but says industry more than architecture to me</td>', 'Great view of seattle! Seems a little overexposed on the right, and perhaps just a little fuzzy/too noisy on the left. Suprised you got this close and this shot with security. Ive tried to get here before and definately got turned away. Its really very nice, but says industry more than architecture to me', '2008-02-04 23:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4458979, 638080, 57777, '<td valign="top">cool subjuect, but I think that pulling back just a hair would have helped so much! Cutting off the little white circle window thing in the lower left corner hurt this IMHO. If that circle was complete, it would have really completed this shots semetry.</td>', 'cool subjuect, but I think that pulling back just a hair would have helped so much! Cutting off the little white circle window thing in the lower left corner hurt this IMHO. If that circle was complete, it would have really completed this shots semetry.', '2008-02-04 23:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
