(4460019, 639341, 82814, '<td valign="top">I like the uniquness of this angle/perspective, however I personally would have cropped this one down so that the angle of the stair rail was an exact diagonal from top left to bottom right.  You would not have lost any of the important detail, but would have given the shot an architechtual balance.</td>', 'I like the uniquness of this angle/perspective, however I personally would have cropped this one down so that the angle of the stair rail was an exact diagonal from top left to bottom right.  You would not have lost any of the important detail, but would have given the shot an architechtual balance.', '2008-02-05 12:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460025, 638217, 82814, '<td valign="top">I''m liking this angle.  Most people would shoot it square on, but this angle gives it that "spiderman with a camera" feel.</td>', 'I''m liking this angle.  Most people would shoot it square on, but this angle gives it that "spiderman with a camera" feel.', '2008-02-05 12:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460031, 639887, 82814, '<td valign="top">The building is certainly very interesting.  I wonder if there is a way to shoot this structure dead on with no other buildings in the frame?  Either way, good eye for detail and perspective.  I find the lower right building takes away from an otherwise cool shot.</td>', 'The building is certainly very interesting.  I wonder if there is a way to shoot this structure dead on with no other buildings in the frame?  Either way, good eye for detail and perspective.  I find the lower right building takes away from an otherwise cool shot.', '2008-02-05 12:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460037, 639648, 82814, '<td valign="top">I truly wish there were structures where I lived that had this much charm and character.  Well done.  If I had any critique, I would like to have seen more depth of colour tone to enhance the murals - perhaps a light/shadow tweek or a curves adjustment would work.</td>', 'I truly wish there were structures where I lived that had this much charm and character.  Well done.  If I had any critique, I would like to have seen more depth of colour tone to enhance the murals - perhaps a light/shadow tweek or a curves adjustment would work.', '2008-02-05 12:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460052, 639914, 82814, '<td valign="top">Excellent colour and sharpness.  Good example of the rule of 3rds.</td>', 'Excellent colour and sharpness.  Good example of the rule of 3rds.', '2008-02-05 12:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460053, 638006, 57777, '<td valign="top">Very pretty location. The lighting on this seems very flat. A bit of contrast, I think, would help this image.</td>', 'Very pretty location. The lighting on this seems very flat. A bit of contrast, I think, would help this image.', '2008-02-05 12:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460056, 640073, 57777, '<td valign="top">Definately a creative approach to architecture. The only thing my eye gravitates to though, is the blue pen. I think that this takes to much attention away from the photo.</td>', 'Definately a creative approach to architecture. The only thing my eye gravitates to though, is the blue pen. I think that this takes to much attention away from the photo.', '2008-02-05 12:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460057, 639518, 57777, '<td valign="top">Love the idea behind this picture. Great angle, and your exposure for the inside is great. I think tat it is a tad overexposed outside, which is unfortunate. Great concept and angle. Good work!</td>', 'Love the idea behind this picture. Great angle, and your exposure for the inside is great. I think tat it is a tad overexposed outside, which is unfortunate. Great concept and angle. Good work!', '2008-02-05 12:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460063, 639577, 57777, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, though I think that the people take away from the architecture that this challenge is about a bit too much. Nice sky, and great technique. Still a very nice shot, just pulls away from architecture to much for me</td>', 'Very nice picture, though I think that the people take away from the architecture that this challenge is about a bit too much. Nice sky, and great technique. Still a very nice shot, just pulls away from architecture to much for me', '2008-02-05 12:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460067, 639455, 57777, '<td valign="top">I love how busy this picture is. Definately taken at a high angle, great work! I love the lighting and colors as well. Very nice job</td>', 'I love how busy this picture is. Definately taken at a high angle, great work! I love the lighting and colors as well. Very nice job', '2008-02-05 12:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
