(4460073, 639212, 57777, '<td valign="top">Nice  framing on this. I would have squatted down a bit more to give the top of the tower just a bit of breathing room inside your frame though. Still a very nice piece of work!</td>', 'Nice  framing on this. I would have squatted down a bit more to give the top of the tower just a bit of breathing room inside your frame though. Still a very nice piece of work!', '2008-02-05 12:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460077, 637432, 57777, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, and way to look at something ordinary and try to make it extraordinary. I have a couple thoughts about this though- first, it definately doesnt meet the architecture challenge idea IMHO. Second, i think that bumping the contrast up here would help alot. The way it looks right now is a little to muddy for me!</td>', 'Interesting concept, and way to look at something ordinary and try to make it extraordinary. I have a couple thoughts about this though- first, it definately doesnt meet the architecture challenge idea IMHO. Second, i think that bumping the contrast up here would help alot. The way it looks right now is a little to muddy for me!', '2008-02-05 12:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460081, 639625, 57777, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful subject. I wish the sky was blue, to ad more contrast! I think that pulling back a little and seeing the edges of the thing leaning out of the frame may have helped. Still a very nice shot! good work</td>', 'Very beautiful subject. I wish the sky was blue, to ad more contrast! I think that pulling back a little and seeing the edges of the thing leaning out of the frame may have helped. Still a very nice shot! good work', '2008-02-05 12:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460087, 638284, 57777, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful lighting, nice shape, and great job catching the reflection.  Looks like a great picee of architecture, and you found a good angle to shoot it at! Nice work</td>', 'Very beautiful lighting, nice shape, and great job catching the reflection.  Looks like a great picee of architecture, and you found a good angle to shoot it at! Nice work', '2008-02-05 12:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460091, 639741, 57777, '<td valign="top">Very unique angle and way to shoot this. I dont know how to feel about the 2. Its different, thats for sure, but I am very interested more with the building in the background, and would play with the idea of zooming in more on that. Still technically solid and a good shot!</td>', 'Very unique angle and way to shoot this. I dont know how to feel about the 2. Its different, thats for sure, but I am very interested more with the building in the background, and would play with the idea of zooming in more on that. Still technically solid and a good shot!', '2008-02-05 12:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460096, 637831, 57777, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work, nice shape, colors, lines, everything. I think it being possibly a bit brighter, and more saturated would help, though I am definately not complaining :)! Would be very interested in knowing where this is taken.</td>', 'Beautiful work, nice shape, colors, lines, everything. I think it being possibly a bit brighter, and more saturated would help, though I am definately not complaining :)! Would be very interested in knowing where this is taken.', '2008-02-05 12:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460115, 639577, 88699, '<td valign="top">that is a really cool photo!  but it looks like the bridge is a little out of focus, it could have worked better if the skater was slightly out of focus and the bridge was.</td>', 'that is a really cool photo!  but it looks like the bridge is a little out of focus, it could have worked better if the skater was slightly out of focus and the bridge was.', '2008-02-05 12:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460121, 639783, 88699, '<td valign="top">i like it but you could''ve expierimented with different angles, this is kind of boring</td>', 'i like it but you could''ve expierimented with different angles, this is kind of boring', '2008-02-05 12:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460122, 638824, 88699, '<td valign="top">i like the contrast in colors</td>', 'i like the contrast in colors', '2008-02-05 12:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460127, 640023, 88699, '<td valign="top">oh no!!  it''s a great picture only it''s noisy/grainy!  that''s going to put you back...</td>', 'oh no!!  it''s a great picture only it''s noisy/grainy!  that''s going to put you back...', '2008-02-05 12:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460128, 639786, 82814, '<td valign="top">I like this subject; strong structure against a soft sky &amp; the light and shadow amplifies the columns architecture, but I was left wishing there were a third column on the left side of the shot.  Maybe a portrait layout would change that.  Also, a single column shot smack dab in the middle of this blue sky would be clean, simple &amp; effective as well...then you would have a giant single concrete DNA strand.  You could easily have two great shots here if you split the two colums and made two portrait shots - the right column dead centre, and the left column cropped to show a wide blue void on the far right.  I''m no expert, but this is what I see as possiblities.  One more thing, a longer exposure would have made the clouds more whispy looking reinforcing the strong/soft appeal.</td>', 'I like this subject; strong structure against a soft sky & the light and shadow amplifies the columns architecture, but I was left wishing there were a third column on the left side of the shot.  Maybe a portrait layout would change that.  Also, a single column shot smack dab in the middle of this blue sky would be clean, simple & effective as well...then you would have a giant single concrete DNA strand.  You could easily have two great shots here if you split the two colums and made two portrait shots - the right column dead centre, and the left column cropped to show a wide blue void on the far right.  I''m no expert, but this is what I see as possiblities.  One more thing, a longer exposure would have made the clouds more whispy looking reinforcing the strong/soft appeal.', '2008-02-05 12:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460132, 639728, 88699, '<td valign="top">it''s a cool picture, i just don''t think that a silo counts as architecture.</td>', 'it''s a cool picture, i just don''t think that a silo counts as architecture.', '2008-02-05 12:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460133, 639317, 88699, '<td valign="top">nice, i like the reflections on the mirrors</td>', 'nice, i like the reflections on the mirrors', '2008-02-05 12:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460136, 638339, 88699, '<td valign="top">the picture doesn''t seem to be in that great of focus...</td>', 'the picture doesn''t seem to be in that great of focus...', '2008-02-05 12:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460140, 638828, 88699, '<td valign="top">great picture, i think it would''ve looked better in color instead of sepia.</td>', 'great picture, i think it would''ve looked better in color instead of sepia.', '2008-02-05 12:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460141, 638065, 88699, '<td valign="top">is that building even finished?</td>', 'is that building even finished?', '2008-02-05 12:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460143, 639708, 82814, '<td valign="top">I am sooo loving this perspective.  Very cool shot.  9.</td>', 'I am sooo loving this perspective.  Very cool shot.  9.', '2008-02-05 12:42:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4460146, 639471, 88699, '<td valign="top">how can that cathedral be abandoned?!  it''s beautiful!  the picture is very right because of the white clouds behind it.  probably could''ve worked better in color.</td>', 'how can that cathedral be abandoned?!  it''s beautiful!  the picture is very right because of the white clouds behind it.  probably could''ve worked better in color.', '2008-02-05 12:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460147, 639666, 82814, '<td valign="top">This is simply brilliant.  Well done. 9</td>', 'This is simply brilliant.  Well done. 9', '2008-02-05 12:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460153, 637904, 82814, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot.  May have been a bit better (for me) if the angle was on an exact 45 degree.  Light and colour are excellent. 9</td>', 'I like this one a lot.  May have been a bit better (for me) if the angle was on an exact 45 degree.  Light and colour are excellent. 9', '2008-02-05 12:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460157, 637527, 82814, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous capture.  9</td>', 'Gorgeous capture.  9', '2008-02-05 12:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460169, 638828, 82814, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing colour tones and perspective.  9</td>', 'Very pleasing colour tones and perspective.  9', '2008-02-05 12:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460232, 639705, 57777, '<td valign="top">Love the light and color here! Great work! You really made something so ordinary look great. Definately my favorite for creativity. Good angle as well</td>', 'Love the light and color here! Great work! You really made something so ordinary look great. Definately my favorite for creativity. Good angle as well', '2008-02-05 13:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460270, 639317, 51538, '<td valign="top">There are some artifacts around the rim of the building.  I think that this subject matter really requires perfection in presentation.  The sky is nicely processed and I expect that you could have avoided the artifacts if this was not run under basic rules editing.</td>', 'There are some artifacts around the rim of the building.  I think that this subject matter really requires perfection in presentation.  The sky is nicely processed and I expect that you could have avoided the artifacts if this was not run under basic rules editing.', '2008-02-05 13:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460387, 639558, 89583, '<td valign="top">The upside-down flag is a bit distracting, otherwise very interesting!</td>', 'The upside-down flag is a bit distracting, otherwise very interesting!', '2008-02-05 14:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460415, 638800, 57777, '<td valign="top">This really is a very nice location, but I feel that the angle that this was taken at really doesnt have anything that "catches my eye". The lighting and texture are beautiful, it just needs a "draws my eye" element</td>', 'This really is a very nice location, but I feel that the angle that this was taken at really doesnt have anything that "catches my eye". The lighting and texture are beautiful, it just needs a "draws my eye" element', '2008-02-05 14:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460438, 637892, 57777, '<td valign="top">Great picture, nice angle and very cool lighting. I guess if I were to do one thing different it would be do do a longer exposure, and get some trails from the cars with lights on down on the road, though I am being pretty nit-picky. Good shot, and a good score from me!</td>', 'Great picture, nice angle and very cool lighting. I guess if I were to do one thing different it would be do do a longer exposure, and get some trails from the cars with lights on down on the road, though I am being pretty nit-picky. Good shot, and a good score from me!', '2008-02-05 14:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460565, 638069, 88656, '<td valign="top">I really love your picture! The lighting is really cool because it makes your picture sparkle. Where did you thake this?</td>', 'I really love your picture! The lighting is really cool because it makes your picture sparkle. Where did you thake this?', '2008-02-05 15:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460573, 639358, 88656, '<td valign="top">This imo is a great example of architecture. I love the sky in the background and the angle you shot this at. Good photo!</td>', 'This imo is a great example of architecture. I love the sky in the background and the angle you shot this at. Good photo!', '2008-02-05 15:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460590, 638126, 88656, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the old and the new architecture of the buildings. I also really like the reflection in the windows. good picture!</td>', 'I like the contrast between the old and the new architecture of the buildings. I also really like the reflection in the windows. good picture!', '2008-02-05 15:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460592, 639588, 88656, '<td valign="top">The lighting of the columns and things makes your photo come alive! I love it! great job!</td>', 'The lighting of the columns and things makes your photo come alive! I love it! great job!', '2008-02-05 15:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460602, 638136, 88656, '<td valign="top">I love the look of old churches! This one is so beautiful. I really like how everything is dark except for the alter! Good Job!</td>', 'I love the look of old churches! This one is so beautiful. I really like how everything is dark except for the alter! Good Job!', '2008-02-05 15:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460608, 638811, 88656, '<td valign="top">I love the color and the angle of your picture. It is very powerful! Good Job!</td>', 'I love the color and the angle of your picture. It is very powerful! Good Job!', '2008-02-05 15:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460873, 639786, 61961, '<td valign="top">One of my challenge faves, so far.  Interesting shapes, interesting detail, nicely composed, and I like the play of light and dark "steps".  It''s good that you are looking straight on and not looking up.</td>', 'One of my challenge faves, so far.  Interesting shapes, interesting detail, nicely composed, and I like the play of light and dark "steps".  It''s good that you are looking straight on and not looking up.', '2008-02-05 16:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460880, 637251, 61961, '<td valign="top">I think this is an example of how a photo can be good without being super-sharp.  I like the dreamy quality and the shadows on the tower.</td>', 'I think this is an example of how a photo can be good without being super-sharp.  I like the dreamy quality and the shadows on the tower.', '2008-02-05 16:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460881, 639558, 61961, '<td valign="top">Wow, this really is colorful.  Good control on the exposure (interior is bright yet the windows are blown).  Good compositional shapes.</td>', 'Wow, this really is colorful.  Good control on the exposure (interior is bright yet the windows are blown).  Good compositional shapes.', '2008-02-05 16:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460888, 638514, 61961, '<td valign="top">Excellent job on the B&amp;W conversion.  The frame works with the photo.</td>', 'Excellent job on the B&W conversion.  The frame works with the photo.', '2008-02-05 16:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460893, 639602, 61961, '<td valign="top">I was sort of prejudiced against this photo because I saw in past Architecture challenges how popular the bridge photos were -- yet everytime I look at this I like it more and more.  Love the gray tones, subdued colors and the symmetrical, abstract quality.</td>', 'I was sort of prejudiced against this photo because I saw in past Architecture challenges how popular the bridge photos were -- yet everytime I look at this I like it more and more.  Love the gray tones, subdued colors and the symmetrical, abstract quality.', '2008-02-05 16:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460897, 639624, 61961, '<td valign="top">Terrific architectural detail.  I should be bothered by the "dirty" windows, but I''m not.  Looks like you did some heavy denoising or something that gives it a slightly dreamy/smooth quality, but I like it.</td>', 'Terrific architectural detail.  I should be bothered by the "dirty" windows, but I''m not.  Looks like you did some heavy denoising or something that gives it a slightly dreamy/smooth quality, but I like it.', '2008-02-05 16:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460904, 639858, 61961, '<td valign="top">I love this shape, good composition, nice colors... a little sharper would move it higher up the list for me, but still at least an 8.</td>', 'I love this shape, good composition, nice colors... a little sharper would move it higher up the list for me, but still at least an 8.', '2008-02-05 16:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460908, 639821, 61961, '<td valign="top">I like how the building stands alone.  It reminds me of an old fashioned postcard.  Good b&amp;w, though an old fashioned "hand colored" look might be interesting, too.</td>', 'I like how the building stands alone.  It reminds me of an old fashioned postcard.  Good b&w, though an old fashioned "hand colored" look might be interesting, too.', '2008-02-05 17:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460974, 639382, 88926, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective of the shot.</td>', 'I like the perspective of the shot.', '2008-02-05 17:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460981, 637904, 88926, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, good focus.</td>', 'Nice colors, good focus.', '2008-02-05 17:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4460986, 639978, 88926, '<td valign="top">Good choice on the title.</td>', 'Good choice on the title.', '2008-02-05 17:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461037, 639738, 57777, '<td valign="top">Great exposure, building, etc. My only problem with this shot is that it is taken at such a normal angle. I think you could have added several points to your score by different angles, just shooting some of the details, or being a little more creative. Dont get me wrong, great shot, and will still score well, just want to help improvement :)</td>', 'Great exposure, building, etc. My only problem with this shot is that it is taken at such a normal angle. I think you could have added several points to your score by different angles, just shooting some of the details, or being a little more creative. Dont get me wrong, great shot, and will still score well, just want to help improvement :)', '2008-02-05 18:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461039, 639906, 57777, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and angles on this. Very nice shot. I think a little more directional light and contrast may have helped in some areas, but good work none the less</td>', 'I love the colors and angles on this. Very nice shot. I think a little more directional light and contrast may have helped in some areas, but good work none the less', '2008-02-05 18:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461040, 637903, 57777, '<td valign="top">Great work! The statue on the bottom is a bit to blown oit for me, but the colors, texture and exposure on the rest is great. Awesome building! Good work</td>', 'Great work! The statue on the bottom is a bit to blown oit for me, but the colors, texture and exposure on the rest is great. Awesome building! Good work', '2008-02-05 18:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461042, 638932, 88926, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the old look of the wood.</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the old look of the wood.', '2008-02-05 18:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461044, 639361, 57777, '<td valign="top">A very interesting building for sure. Great choice of a subject. I think that a longer exposure, or cropping to take the people out would have made this shot a lot more professional looking. Good shot still though</td>', 'A very interesting building for sure. Great choice of a subject. I think that a longer exposure, or cropping to take the people out would have made this shot a lot more professional looking. Good shot still though', '2008-02-05 18:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461053, 639674, 57777, '<td valign="top">good use of color, and good crop! I think I would have thrown the back just a little more out of focus to bring more attention to the dome. Good shot!</td>', 'good use of color, and good crop! I think I would have thrown the back just a little more out of focus to bring more attention to the dome. Good shot!', '2008-02-05 18:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461055, 638602, 57777, '<td valign="top">Definately industrial. Love the look of this. Very dark, and different, but a clean shot. It definately is cold, and kind of puts you "in the shot". Good work!</td>', 'Definately industrial. Love the look of this. Very dark, and different, but a clean shot. It definately is cold, and kind of puts you "in the shot". Good work!', '2008-02-05 18:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461057, 639915, 57777, '<td valign="top">nice patterns and lines. Seems a bit dark to me, so lightening it up would help. Colors are very pretty though, and the angle is nice. Good work!</td>', 'nice patterns and lines. Seems a bit dark to me, so lightening it up would help. Colors are very pretty though, and the angle is nice. Good work!', '2008-02-05 18:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461059, 637811, 57777, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! Sky is great, very intriging subject, and the lighting on the bottom is pretty cool. Great work!</td>', 'Beautiful shot! Sky is great, very intriging subject, and the lighting on the bottom is pretty cool. Great work!', '2008-02-05 18:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461062, 638545, 57777, '<td valign="top">GREAT balance with the edges of the other circles. Your colors on the murals could pop a bit more, which would help, but everything else about this is very nice. Seems like something you would see inside a kaleidascope.</td>', 'GREAT balance with the edges of the other circles. Your colors on the murals could pop a bit more, which would help, but everything else about this is very nice. Seems like something you would see inside a kaleidascope.', '2008-02-05 18:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461064, 638419, 57777, '<td valign="top">Very nice angle, and approach. I think I would have either used some fill, or lightened some things up as well. Good work</td>', 'Very nice angle, and approach. I think I would have either used some fill, or lightened some things up as well. Good work', '2008-02-05 18:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461069, 639332, 57777, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject for sure, but I like it. The exposure and conversion to BW looks great. I think that perhaps getting lower, and angling the camera up a hair, to make the bridge just look TOWERING would have been a cool approach and angle, though what you have is very nice!</td>', 'Interesting subject for sure, but I like it. The exposure and conversion to BW looks great. I think that perhaps getting lower, and angling the camera up a hair, to make the bridge just look TOWERING would have been a cool approach and angle, though what you have is very nice!', '2008-02-05 18:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461071, 639287, 57777, '<td valign="top">The texture on the ceiling is great, and this definately has some potential. I think stepping to the left a hair, and shooting down the wall more, eliminating the outside of the archways would have helped (or perhaps just cropping). Also, it feels to overexposed.</td>', 'The texture on the ceiling is great, and this definately has some potential. I think stepping to the left a hair, and shooting down the wall more, eliminating the outside of the archways would have helped (or perhaps just cropping). Also, it feels to overexposed.', '2008-02-05 18:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461072, 638456, 57777, '<td valign="top">I like the silohuette idea, but it still does look just a little underexposed. Interesting subject and idea, different from the rest. Good shot.</td>', 'I like the silohuette idea, but it still does look just a little underexposed. Interesting subject and idea, different from the rest. Good shot.', '2008-02-05 18:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461073, 639405, 57777, '<td valign="top">Its an interesting shot, but I must admit I really had to study it, as the reflection at the bottom just looks awkward. I love the tones and vanashing point, but wonder if cropping the reflection out may have helped.</td>', 'Its an interesting shot, but I must admit I really had to study it, as the reflection at the bottom just looks awkward. I love the tones and vanashing point, but wonder if cropping the reflection out may have helped.', '2008-02-05 18:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461074, 639411, 57777, '<td valign="top">Beautiful angle, and great lens choice! Looks like a giant spiderweb. Could easily just be the natural colors, but if you toned this, that looks great too! STRONG work!</td>', 'Beautiful angle, and great lens choice! Looks like a giant spiderweb. Could easily just be the natural colors, but if you toned this, that looks great too! STRONG work!', '2008-02-05 18:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461075, 639447, 57777, '<td valign="top">Its a very nice shot, and good technically. My only problem with this is that its such a stereotypical postcard shot of this. Some different angles, waiting for a different lighting pattern on it, or different approach would have made this much stronger.</td>', 'Its a very nice shot, and good technically. My only problem with this is that its such a stereotypical postcard shot of this. Some different angles, waiting for a different lighting pattern on it, or different approach would have made this much stronger.', '2008-02-05 18:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461077, 638699, 57777, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, colors and toning! Looks like a very powerful building! Sky looks great, and I love the purple accents in the blue! great work!</td>', 'Beautiful picture, colors and toning! Looks like a very powerful building! Sky looks great, and I love the purple accents in the blue! great work!', '2008-02-05 18:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461078, 639271, 57777, '<td valign="top">Stained glass is always hard, so big props on that! Good framing, and directional lighting. Very technically solid. Good work!</td>', 'Stained glass is always hard, so big props on that! Good framing, and directional lighting. Very technically solid. Good work!', '2008-02-05 18:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461079, 638647, 57777, '<td valign="top">It almost looks like a face! The lines, colors and patterns are very nice! Good approach and cropping. Interesting building and good work</td>', 'It almost looks like a face! The lines, colors and patterns are very nice! Good approach and cropping. Interesting building and good work', '2008-02-05 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461083, 639626, 57777, '<td valign="top">I think a different approach at the rocket would have helped so much. Its an interesting piece of architecture, but I am just to distracted by the building behind it. Your sky looks great, and the tones are nice!</td>', 'I think a different approach at the rocket would have helped so much. Its an interesting piece of architecture, but I am just to distracted by the building behind it. Your sky looks great, and the tones are nice!', '2008-02-05 18:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461087, 639761, 57777, '<td valign="top">Great reflections! Lights definately gave the overall picture an orange tint which is a bit unfortunate. Still a good subject and shot! Way to wait until night time to shoot, and wait for the lighting!</td>', 'Great reflections! Lights definately gave the overall picture an orange tint which is a bit unfortunate. Still a good subject and shot! Way to wait until night time to shoot, and wait for the lighting!', '2008-02-05 18:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461091, 639243, 57777, '<td valign="top">Very busy for an interior, but I like it in this shot! Your lights all show up, and look very good! Very nice choice in tinting as well</td>', 'Very busy for an interior, but I like it in this shot! Your lights all show up, and look very good! Very nice choice in tinting as well', '2008-02-05 18:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461093, 639708, 57777, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, and nice fisheye. Your lighting looks very nice. Great work!</td>', 'Beautiful colors, and nice fisheye. Your lighting looks very nice. Great work!', '2008-02-05 18:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461095, 638609, 57777, '<td valign="top">cool subject and angle and all, just looks a little dark. I think brightening it up, and a longer exposure for the water would have added some points to your score!</td>', 'cool subject and angle and all, just looks a little dark. I think brightening it up, and a longer exposure for the water would have added some points to your score!', '2008-02-05 18:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461096, 639980, 57777, '<td valign="top">cool building and colors, but just seems like a very normal approach to a building. Shooting up at it from a low stance, or a tighter crop may have helped</td>', 'cool building and colors, but just seems like a very normal approach to a building. Shooting up at it from a low stance, or a tighter crop may have helped', '2008-02-05 18:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461102, 638493, 57777, '<td valign="top">Looks like a beautiful garden! The orange light makes it look ALOT less mysterious unfortunately. Also seems a bit soft in some areas. Nice framing and textures!</td>', 'Looks like a beautiful garden! The orange light makes it look ALOT less mysterious unfortunately. Also seems a bit soft in some areas. Nice framing and textures!', '2008-02-05 18:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461104, 639343, 57777, '<td valign="top">Its a very pretty subject and angle, but it just seems to yellow. Adjusting your levels would have helped on this I think. Still a pretty shot!</td>', 'Its a very pretty subject and angle, but it just seems to yellow. Adjusting your levels would have helped on this I think. Still a pretty shot!', '2008-02-05 18:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461107, 639182, 57777, '<td valign="top">Have seen a lot of this IDEA in this contest, but yours really works I think, and it is mostly because of the lighting and contrast. Great shot!</td>', 'Have seen a lot of this IDEA in this contest, but yours really works I think, and it is mostly because of the lighting and contrast. Great shot!', '2008-02-05 18:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461109, 640063, 57777, '<td valign="top">VERY pretty toning on this! Lines and repetition really work. Strong shot!</td>', 'VERY pretty toning on this! Lines and repetition really work. Strong shot!', '2008-02-05 18:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
