(4461114, 639599, 57777, '<td valign="top">good shot, but more of a landscape/cityscape than architecture imho. Colors are great, but may be just a hair dark in some areas. Still a shot to be proud of!</td>', 'good shot, but more of a landscape/cityscape than architecture imho. Colors are great, but may be just a hair dark in some areas. Still a shot to be proud of!', '2008-02-05 18:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
