(4461420, 639705, 43774, '<td valign="top">WOW! Now that is some freaky architecture. I am really glad you photographed this at night to really bring out the detail while eliminating a distracting sky. I often wonder what cities are thinking when they build elaborate structures like this (after all, it''s a bus station, right?). But then again I am glad they do put this "eye candy" out for the public to enjoy. It''s art and architecture.</td>', 'WOW! Now that is some freaky architecture. I am really glad you photographed this at night to really bring out the detail while eliminating a distracting sky. I often wonder what cities are thinking when they build elaborate structures like this (after all, it''s a bus station, right?). But then again I am glad they do put this "eye candy" out for the public to enjoy. It''s art and architecture.', '2008-02-05 21:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461421, 639441, 43774, '<td valign="top">Oh I so want to see this in person! Maybe in a few months I will. I love this photo, the colours are beautiful and it''s an angle I have not seen before.</td>', 'Oh I so want to see this in person! Maybe in a few months I will. I love this photo, the colours are beautiful and it''s an angle I have not seen before.', '2008-02-05 21:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
