(4461788, 638818, 60862, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject.  I''ve long wanted to go down and get interesting shots of these beasts.</td>', 'Good choice of subject.  I''ve long wanted to go down and get interesting shots of these beasts.', '2008-02-05 23:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461792, 640040, 77838, '<td valign="top">Almost feels like a duotone but then I see color in the sky in the bg.  I like the partial ''desat'' feeling here. 9 -BB</td>', 'Almost feels like a duotone but then I see color in the sky in the bg.  I like the partial ''desat'' feeling here. 9 -BB', '2008-02-05 23:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461797, 639328, 77838, '<td valign="top">Great reflections and shapes.  I like this alot. 9 -BB</td>', 'Great reflections and shapes.  I like this alot. 9 -BB', '2008-02-05 23:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461800, 638647, 77838, '<td valign="top">This is almost perfectly symmetrical! Nice framing. 9 -BB</td>', 'This is almost perfectly symmetrical! Nice framing. 9 -BB', '2008-02-05 23:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461814, 638221, 77838, '<td valign="top">The contrast feels really "intense", if you understand what I mean?  The silhouette is great but the background kind of glares a little.</td>', 'The contrast feels really "intense", if you understand what I mean?  The silhouette is great but the background kind of glares a little.', '2008-02-05 23:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461821, 638859, 64844, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!</td>', 'Fantastic!', '2008-02-05 23:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461831, 639477, 77838, '<td valign="top">Your "blues &amp; cyans" color cast is plenty bright on the building and steps.  The sky is a little grainy in the upper righthand corner too.  I like the Architecture idea with the columns. -BB</td>', 'Your "blues & cyans" color cast is plenty bright on the building and steps.  The sky is a little grainy in the upper righthand corner too.  I like the Architecture idea with the columns. -BB', '2008-02-05 23:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461839, 637527, 59925, '<td valign="top">One of my top two in this challenge.</td>', 'One of my top two in this challenge.', '2008-02-05 23:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461840, 637530, 77838, '<td valign="top">The sky is really blown out here and the barn feels a little out of focus.  If it was possible to get inside, I''ll bet some of the old framing beams might have had some good angles to try to shoot and may have not been so bright for you.  <br/>This is just a simple suggestion, please don''t think I''m criticizing your photographer ability here. -BB</td>', 'The sky is really blown out here and the barn feels a little out of focus.  If it was possible to get inside, I''ll bet some of the old framing beams might have had some good angles to try to shoot and may have not been so bright for you.  This is just a simple suggestion, please don''t think I''m criticizing your photographer ability here. -BB', '2008-02-05 23:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461846, 639962, 59925, '<td valign="top">Great job with the lighting and exposure.  One of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Great job with the lighting and exposure.  One of my favorites in this challenge.', '2008-02-05 23:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461854, 639307, 59925, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Really like the contrast between the dark blue sky, white clouds, and the light on the building.</td>', 'Very nice.  Really like the contrast between the dark blue sky, white clouds, and the light on the building.', '2008-02-05 23:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461860, 639649, 77838, '<td valign="top">This photo feels like it was cropped to small and then just enlarged to get it bigger.  You might have been able to crop the original image down to 640pix so that it wouldn''t have pixelated so badly.  Just a suggestion, I like the lighthouse though. -BB</td>', 'This photo feels like it was cropped to small and then just enlarged to get it bigger.  You might have been able to crop the original image down to 640pix so that it wouldn''t have pixelated so badly.  Just a suggestion, I like the lighthouse though. -BB', '2008-02-05 23:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461864, 639504, 77838, '<td valign="top">This photo feels like your ''auto''-focus was off or that you prefocused on a very close object.  It''s really bright too; you''ve lost your detail in the sky and most of the building.  -BB</td>', 'This photo feels like your ''auto''-focus was off or that you prefocused on a very close object.  It''s really bright too; you''ve lost your detail in the sky and most of the building.  -BB', '2008-02-05 23:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461874, 639607, 77838, '<td valign="top">Are you lying on your back on the ground or where you able to just lean back to get this angle?  With the photo rotated like this each of the stairway steps feels like a saw blade!  I know that sounds weird but hey that was my "first" impression.  On second thought, I wondered if this was looking up a lighthouse tower but then realized that there was no ''light'' at the top; or what should''ve been the top.  Nice photo, I like it. -BB</td>', 'Are you lying on your back on the ground or where you able to just lean back to get this angle?  With the photo rotated like this each of the stairway steps feels like a saw blade!  I know that sounds weird but hey that was my "first" impression.  On second thought, I wondered if this was looking up a lighthouse tower but then realized that there was no ''light'' at the top; or what should''ve been the top.  Nice photo, I like it. -BB', '2008-02-05 23:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4461891, 639441, 29011, '<td valign="top">Yep, I knew this would do good. So glad it did great! :)<br/>Congratulations. It''s a most refreshing point of view.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-02-06 00:03:12.</i></td>', 'Yep, I knew this would do good. So glad it did great! :)Congratulations. It''s a most refreshing point of view.', '2008-02-06 00:03:00.000000', '2008-02-06 00:03:12.000000', 0),
(4461892, 640063, 12253, '<td valign="top">Congrat''s Jeffrey!  It turned out very beautiful!</td>', 'Congrat''s Jeffrey!  It turned out very beautiful!', '2008-02-06 00:03:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4461896, 639962, 29011, '<td valign="top">Great finish m8. Very well deserved HM. In the sea of amazing shots in this challenge, top5 is a great finish. Congratulations.</td>', 'Great finish m8. Very well deserved HM. In the sea of amazing shots in this challenge, top5 is a great finish. Congratulations.', '2008-02-06 00:04:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4461904, 639558, 29011, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. Made my top10. A shot that really caught my eye, quite a feast for the eye it is. Congratulations on the ribbon :)</td>', 'Wonderful. Made my top10. A shot that really caught my eye, quite a feast for the eye it is. Congratulations on the ribbon :)', '2008-02-06 00:05:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4461906, 639441, 85886, '<td valign="top">Grats Matthew.  I gave this a 9 and was my highest rated photo.  I still can''t work out where you were standing to get that PoV...</td>', 'Grats Matthew.  I gave this a 9 and was my highest rated photo.  I still can''t work out where you were standing to get that PoV...', '2008-02-06 00:05:47.000000', NULL, 0),
