(4461919, 639801, 29011, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Whimsy and abstract all in one. Very nicely composed, I like you caught the lady in the shot. Congratulations on the top10 finish.</td>', 'I really like this. Whimsy and abstract all in one. Very nicely composed, I like you caught the lady in the shot. Congratulations on the top10 finish.', '2008-02-06 00:09:22.000000', NULL, 0),
