(4462027, 639441, 32001, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors &amp; point of view!  Congrats on your blue :)</td>', 'Excellent colors & point of view!  Congrats on your blue :)', '2008-02-06 00:25:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462062, 639262, 34462, '<td valign="top">what an interesting building and a very interesting sky. It''s fun to play around with the colors and shades available in hue/sat. Do you use a noise filter like Neat Image or Noise Ninja?<br/> <br/></td>', 'what an interesting building and a very interesting sky. It''s fun to play around with the colors and shades available in hue/sat. Do you use a noise filter like Neat Image or Noise Ninja? ', '2008-02-06 00:32:35.000000', NULL, 0),
