(4462087, 639958, 34462, '<td valign="top">Very interesting building and some great colors. You too (like me), chose an interesting POV for your architecture shot. Many folks don''t like to be this close.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Very interesting building and some great colors. You too (like me), chose an interesting POV for your architecture shot. Many folks don''t like to be this close. ', '2008-02-06 00:34:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462123, 640063, 77838, '<td valign="top">Congrats and nice placement; 15 out of 242!  You now hold 2nd and 3rd highest photos taken with your camera, very sweet.  <br/> <br/>I read through your notes but didn''t actually see any specific location other than just "Washington DC".  I thought I recognized the locale (see comment made during voting). -BB</td>', 'Congrats and nice placement; 15 out of 242!  You now hold 2nd and 3rd highest photos taken with your camera, very sweet.   I read through your notes but didn''t actually see any specific location other than just "Washington DC".  I thought I recognized the locale (see comment made during voting). -BB', '2008-02-06 00:39:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462156, 637413, 65319, '<td valign="top">Woooooo Hoooooo, Mary!  A new PB!!!  Congrats!  Wonderful to see your glass filled with champagne...::clink::...Cheers to you!</td>', 'Woooooo Hoooooo, Mary!  A new PB!!!  Congrats!  Wonderful to see your glass filled with champagne...::clink::...Cheers to you!', '2008-02-06 00:48:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462166, 639708, 65319, '<td valign="top">In the challenge, this one was my favorite.  The wide angle and many facets give this cathedral a jewel effect.  Well done and many congrats on your ribbon!!!</td>', 'In the challenge, this one was my favorite.  The wide angle and many facets give this cathedral a jewel effect.  Well done and many congrats on your ribbon!!!', '2008-02-06 00:49:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462211, 639441, 45226, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful</td>', 'This is beautiful', '2008-02-06 00:57:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462223, 639602, 14437, '<td valign="top">My personal second highest score. Thanks for the great comment.<br/> <br/>This shot was taken at Marina Park, Singapore. The exact location is just next to the Starbucks under the bridge. I didn''t purposely shot this for the challenge, as I was just taking some "tourist" photos. Only after viewing this shot on my camera LCD, I decided to enter into this challenge.<br/> <br/></td>', 'My personal second highest score. Thanks for the great comment. This shot was taken at Marina Park, Singapore. The exact location is just next to the Starbucks under the bridge. I didn''t purposely shot this for the challenge, as I was just taking some "tourist" photos. Only after viewing this shot on my camera LCD, I decided to enter into this challenge. ', '2008-02-06 00:59:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462226, 639504, 65319, '<td valign="top">Well, Gordon, this photo leaves much to the imagination (which I believe a few of your commentors need more of BTW) and I imagine an impression of a building not quite concrete, but most certainly taking a shape almost within a dreamscape.  Here is a clear and excellent example where "Less is More."  ;-)<br/> <br/>(Gosh...that reminds me...I have to go do my laundry now...may I borrow your basket?  ::winks::)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-02-06 01:01:06.</i></td>', 'Well, Gordon, this photo leaves much to the imagination (which I believe a few of your commentors need more of BTW) and I imagine an impression of a building not quite concrete, but most certainly taking a shape almost within a dreamscape.  Here is a clear and excellent example where "Less is More."  ;-) (Gosh...that reminds me...I have to go do my laundry now...may I borrow your basket?  ::winks::)', '2008-02-06 00:59:59.000000', '2008-02-06 01:01:06.000000', 0),
(4462285, 639441, 41479, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. Congratulations</td>', 'Gorgeous. Congratulations', '2008-02-06 01:17:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462289, 640063, 65319, '<td valign="top">Oh Jeffrey!  Top 20...Congrats!!!  Beautiful design and detail.</td>', 'Oh Jeffrey!  Top 20...Congrats!!!  Beautiful design and detail.', '2008-02-06 01:19:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462308, 639441, 32602, '<td valign="top">Love the colours, beautiful</td>', 'Love the colours, beautiful', '2008-02-06 01:26:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462328, 638699, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats on top 10, Mae!  Fun shapes and beautiful color in this.</td>', 'Congrats on top 10, Mae!  Fun shapes and beautiful color in this.', '2008-02-06 01:30:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462331, 639801, 60862, '<td valign="top">You certainly beat your average - congrats on your new personal best!</td>', 'You certainly beat your average - congrats on your new personal best!', '2008-02-06 01:31:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462332, 639708, 32602, '<td valign="top">wonderful, love the wide wide view</td>', 'wonderful, love the wide wide view', '2008-02-06 01:31:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462336, 639558, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your ribbon, new personal best, and 1st 7!  I know how special that last bit is. :)  I was one of your 10s, and glad to give it.</td>', 'Congrats on your ribbon, new personal best, and 1st 7!  I know how special that last bit is. :)  I was one of your 10s, and glad to give it.', '2008-02-06 01:33:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462339, 639441, 60862, '<td valign="top">You''ve certainly got the hang of shooting architecture, particularly at night.  Congrats!</td>', 'You''ve certainly got the hang of shooting architecture, particularly at night.  Congrats!', '2008-02-06 01:34:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462343, 637413, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hooray, Mary!  Way to get that new personal best!  I was one of your 9s - just loved the arches, the color, and the repetition of the shapes.  Congrats on the honorable mention, too!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-02-06 01:35:54.</i></td>', 'Hooray, Mary!  Way to get that new personal best!  I was one of your 9s - just loved the arches, the color, and the repetition of the shapes.  Congrats on the honorable mention, too!', '2008-02-06 01:35:27.000000', '2008-02-06 01:35:54.000000', 0),
(4462364, 640023, 65319, '<td valign="top">Deb...a lovely winter scene!  I love the branches at the top in front of the apex of the building!  A good perspective with the dark building against the stark yet soft contrast of the snowy background!</td>', 'Deb...a lovely winter scene!  I love the branches at the top in front of the apex of the building!  A good perspective with the dark building against the stark yet soft contrast of the snowy background!', '2008-02-06 01:40:02.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4462445, 638699, 66524, '<td valign="top">Well done Mae.  Congrats on top 10 finish!</td>', 'Well done Mae.  Congrats on top 10 finish!', '2008-02-06 01:56:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462472, 639441, 50935, '<td valign="top">Outstanding... colorful and sharp. I see we have 2 rats in the kitchen.</td>', 'Outstanding... colorful and sharp. I see we have 2 rats in the kitchen.', '2008-02-06 02:09:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462506, 639958, 67237, '<td valign="top">You are getting better at controlling your exposures!!. This is well exposed, maybe 1/3 f stop low, but it could be corrected with curves an levels. Too bad there were not interesting clouds in the sky. With that lens you could try a wider composition at 18mm to get some ground. Maybe you did but there were some ditracting elements you did not want to show.  <br/></td>', 'You are getting better at controlling your exposures!!. This is well exposed, maybe 1/3 f stop low, but it could be corrected with curves an levels. Too bad there were not interesting clouds in the sky. With that lens you could try a wider composition at 18mm to get some ground. Maybe you did but there were some ditracting elements you did not want to show.  ', '2008-02-06 02:29:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462518, 639441, 20608, '<td valign="top">look at you..... we have a great team.</td>', 'look at you..... we have a great team.', '2008-02-06 02:35:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462548, 639708, 20608, '<td valign="top">Hey Gloda...  congrats</td>', 'Hey Gloda...  congrats', '2008-02-06 02:45:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462552, 637413, 20608, '<td valign="top">Great shot, one of the best</td>', 'Great shot, one of the best', '2008-02-06 02:46:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462556, 638699, 65713, '<td valign="top">Really like the composition and framing of the shot as is but would be curious to see another shot from a lower angle. The colour is beautiful but a little clearer contrast between the sky and the building would have made it a little stronger for me. Great shot though and congrats on a top ten place!</td>', 'Really like the composition and framing of the shot as is but would be curious to see another shot from a lower angle. The colour is beautiful but a little clearer contrast between the sky and the building would have made it a little stronger for me. Great shot though and congrats on a top ten place!', '2008-02-06 02:47:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4462563, 639946, 20608, '<td valign="top">good finish darling 36th is solid in this. great to have you back shooting again......kind of</td>', 'good finish darling 36th is solid in this. great to have you back shooting again......kind of', '2008-02-06 02:49:45.000000', NULL, 0),
