(4463030, 639411, 63269, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. Something about that POV makes me feel like I''m actually there, craning my head back and looking up at the dizzying heights. That, combined with the elegant lighting, beautiful shadows and rich tones, makes this a superb shot. I love it. :)</td>', 'Wonderful. Something about that POV makes me feel like I''m actually there, craning my head back and looking up at the dizzying heights. That, combined with the elegant lighting, beautiful shadows and rich tones, makes this a superb shot. I love it. :)', '2008-02-06 07:10:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4463043, 639602, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well... unfortunately the first thing that caught my eye was the jagged, pixely lines of the lights. But when I really looked at it and tried to imagine it without the jagged lines... I realized this would probably be a glorious photo. The kind that, as <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=65234" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">MaryO</a> mentioned down below, makes your jaw drop because it''s so inexplicably fantastic. Wonderful!</td>', 'Well... unfortunately the first thing that caught my eye was the jagged, pixely lines of the lights. But when I really looked at it and tried to imagine it without the jagged lines... I realized this would probably be a glorious photo. The kind that, as  MaryO mentioned down below, makes your jaw drop because it''s so inexplicably fantastic. Wonderful!', '2008-02-06 07:14:00.000000', NULL, 0),
