(4463335, 639574, 61651, '<td valign="top">How odd - I could have sworn I commented on this.  I was one of your 10s - thought it was nicely creative for the challenge, and shot well.  This did not deserve so low a score.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-02-06 09:10:14.</i></td>', 'How odd - I could have sworn I commented on this.  I was one of your 10s - thought it was nicely creative for the challenge, and shot well.  This did not deserve so low a score.', '2008-02-06 09:09:54.000000', '2008-02-06 09:10:14.000000', 0),
