(4464035, 638554, 61961, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  It''s a very photogenic location.  I had many similar, but ended up submitting this one: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=639891" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/809/120/639891.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/809/120/639891.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/809/120/639891.jpg"/></a>.  In the middle of shooting, I got escorted out by two security guards!</td>', 'Nice shot.  It''s a very photogenic location.  I had many similar, but ended up submitting this one: .  In the middle of shooting, I got escorted out by two security guards!', '2008-02-06 10:50:46.000000', NULL, 0),
