(4464697, 639574, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oh this is really nice - I like it!  I love how the one bird is in focus and then both kind of balance out the two support towers of the bridge.  The colortone is perfect for the misty, blurry scene.</td>', 'Oh this is really nice - I like it!  I love how the one bird is in focus and then both kind of balance out the two support towers of the bridge.  The colortone is perfect for the misty, blurry scene.', '2008-02-06 14:12:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4464712, 639877, 67697, '<td valign="top">The colors are the first thing that caught my eye.  And I like the birds flying by.  They give it that "classic scene" feeling.</td>', 'The colors are the first thing that caught my eye.  And I like the birds flying by.  They give it that "classic scene" feeling.', '2008-02-06 14:15:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4464720, 639574, 62318, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, surprised this did not do better. Very good synergy between the bridge and the birds. It is like architecture reflected in nature. Kind of a bummer on the score. Well thought out and a good fit for the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm, surprised this did not do better. Very good synergy between the bridge and the birds. It is like architecture reflected in nature. Kind of a bummer on the score. Well thought out and a good fit for the challenge.', '2008-02-06 14:18:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4464725, 639881, 67697, '<td valign="top">There''s something eerie cool about this but I can''t quite find a way to describe why I feel that way.  I love how the walkway leads into the white unknown.  The people look like stick figures drawn in, like this is an artists rendering and the added people give it some life.  I like the details you can see on the wall there too.</td>', 'There''s something eerie cool about this but I can''t quite find a way to describe why I feel that way.  I love how the walkway leads into the white unknown.  The people look like stick figures drawn in, like this is an artists rendering and the added people give it some life.  I like the details you can see on the wall there too.', '2008-02-06 14:18:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4464728, 639881, 62318, '<td valign="top">I really like the hard edge style. Very modern feeling and compliments the surrounding architecture nicely. I would have been proud myself to have taken such a photo.</td>', 'I really like the hard edge style. Very modern feeling and compliments the surrounding architecture nicely. I would have been proud myself to have taken such a photo.', '2008-02-06 14:19:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4464739, 640063, 67697, '<td valign="top">I was just comparing this to the other shot you listed here and I have to say that I really like the color tone on this.  The neutrality allows you to follow the curving path with out distraction.  The patterns and geometry are really beautiful.</td>', 'I was just comparing this to the other shot you listed here and I have to say that I really like the color tone on this.  The neutrality allows you to follow the curving path with out distraction.  The patterns and geometry are really beautiful.', '2008-02-06 14:21:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4464780, 637610, 62318, '<td valign="top">I really like the setup here. The various shapes and the lone person really make this exciting. One thing I have noticed about my own shots lately, and what I think might apply here is that it is a bit flat. Not in the contrast per say, but in the dimensions. I have noticed that my shots that a lot of the action/interest is on a single plane. I think that may be why this scored lower in the challenge here. Perhaps some in the bottom right on the ground would have given it bit more ummph. Just a guess though, I talk the talk sometimes but rarely do the walking ;) As for the actual content and post work on the shot it is truly amazing. It really is a wonderful fit to the challenge and should have done much better.</td>', 'I really like the setup here. The various shapes and the lone person really make this exciting. One thing I have noticed about my own shots lately, and what I think might apply here is that it is a bit flat. Not in the contrast per say, but in the dimensions. I have noticed that my shots that a lot of the action/interest is on a single plane. I think that may be why this scored lower in the challenge here. Perhaps some in the bottom right on the ground would have given it bit more ummph. Just a guess though, I talk the talk sometimes but rarely do the walking ;) As for the actual content and post work on the shot it is truly amazing. It really is a wonderful fit to the challenge and should have done much better.', '2008-02-06 14:31:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4464784, 639988, 67697, '<td valign="top">You know, maybe someone did what you described, while designing that arch.  Maybe they had these shapes in mind.  I didn''t catch what you saw but my first thought was that it looks like the arch has a natural curtain hanging over it.  I like the contrast between the soft arch and the sharp tree.</td>', 'You know, maybe someone did what you described, while designing that arch.  Maybe they had these shapes in mind.  I didn''t catch what you saw but my first thought was that it looks like the arch has a natural curtain hanging over it.  I like the contrast between the soft arch and the sharp tree.', '2008-02-06 14:32:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4464798, 639262, 67697, '<td valign="top">Whenever I see a picture of a temple, I always think of Japan.  And the first thing that struck me is that your clouds in the background look like snow covered mountains!  I thought that was pretty cool.  Playing with saturation is a tricky thing, and I think this is what created the obvious appearance of noise that everyone is talking about.  You need to get that noise ninja stuff, you''d be surprised what that can do for a photo.</td>', 'Whenever I see a picture of a temple, I always think of Japan.  And the first thing that struck me is that your clouds in the background look like snow covered mountains!  I thought that was pretty cool.  Playing with saturation is a tricky thing, and I think this is what created the obvious appearance of noise that everyone is talking about.  You need to get that noise ninja stuff, you''d be surprised what that can do for a photo.', '2008-02-06 14:35:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4464802, 639936, 67697, '<td valign="top">Beautiful white contrast against the dark sky.  It''s funny how smooth and curvy this building is.  Looks like a stack of legos :P<br/>Great looking photo, Alicia!</td>', 'Beautiful white contrast against the dark sky.  It''s funny how smooth and curvy this building is.  Looks like a stack of legos :PGreat looking photo, Alicia!', '2008-02-06 14:38:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4464810, 639958, 67697, '<td valign="top">This looks like a really interesting building.  I bet when the sun shines on it the colors are bright and vibrant.  I''m curious about the textured diamond shapes too.  I don''t think you can do much with the way the weather was, but I would love to see this with a little more contrast.</td>', 'This looks like a really interesting building.  I bet when the sun shines on it the colors are bright and vibrant.  I''m curious about the textured diamond shapes too.  I don''t think you can do much with the way the weather was, but I would love to see this with a little more contrast.', '2008-02-06 14:40:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4464818, 639994, 67697, '<td valign="top">Well, I don''t know what to say lol other than I don''t know what people want to see in an architecture shot.  It''s simple and straightforward and I love how it''s reaching up into that gorgeous deep blue sky.</td>', 'Well, I don''t know what to say lol other than I don''t know what people want to see in an architecture shot.  It''s simple and straightforward and I love how it''s reaching up into that gorgeous deep blue sky.', '2008-02-06 14:42:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4464836, 640023, 67697, '<td valign="top">What a pretty scene!  I love the shadows on the bridge and then the puffs of snow on that bush to the right.  I think this could use a bit of a boost in either contrast or a curves adjustment - but then of course you run the risk of losing some detail in the bridge.  <br/> <br/>Sincerely,<br/> <br/>Your #1 FAN!!!!!!  :D</td>', 'What a pretty scene!  I love the shadows on the bridge and then the puffs of snow on that bush to the right.  I think this could use a bit of a boost in either contrast or a curves adjustment - but then of course you run the risk of losing some detail in the bridge.   Sincerely, Your #1 FAN!!!!!!  :D', '2008-02-06 14:47:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4464885, 639801, 58618, '<td valign="top">great photo! a typical libeskind.. had this been advanced editing i would say it would be nice to clone out the reflections of buildings across the street in the lower left window.. its a bit distracting but still nice shot.</td>', 'great photo! a typical libeskind.. had this been advanced editing i would say it would be nice to clone out the reflections of buildings across the street in the lower left window.. its a bit distracting but still nice shot.', '2008-02-06 14:58:56.000000', NULL, 0),
