(4465743, 639993, 33352, '<td valign="top">MMmmmm! nice subject good photography, IMHO if you had moved the camera to the left and aligned the chimney with the edge of the frame the inward distaution would have disappeared, which is what I believe cost you a lot of higher scores. If you remember we discussed this in the earlier challenge when you did this shot, but in basic you can not do what you could then.</td>', 'MMmmmm! nice subject good photography, IMHO if you had moved the camera to the left and aligned the chimney with the edge of the frame the inward distaution would have disappeared, which is what I believe cost you a lot of higher scores. If you remember we discussed this in the earlier challenge when you did this shot, but in basic you can not do what you could then.', '2008-02-06 18:22:44.000000', NULL, 0),
