(4466197, 639504, 66597, '<td valign="top">Well, Gordon, I see you are well on your way to keeping your promise to take only out-of-focus photos this year :-) Problem is, the photo still works, at least to my eye. I didn''t vote, but would have given you a right decent score. It''s actually a refreshing break from the uber-sharp and very colorful images. Sorry you missed that coveted brown by one shot, LOL.</td>', 'Well, Gordon, I see you are well on your way to keeping your promise to take only out-of-focus photos this year :-) Problem is, the photo still works, at least to my eye. I didn''t vote, but would have given you a right decent score. It''s actually a refreshing break from the uber-sharp and very colorful images. Sorry you missed that coveted brown by one shot, LOL.', '2008-02-06 20:40:06.000000', NULL, 0),
