(4480842, 639594, 30982, '<td valign="top">Between this and your outtakes, I think I need to visit Düsseldorf.  What interesting buildings!  Nice work with basic, too.</td>', 'Between this and your outtakes, I think I need to visit Düsseldorf.  What interesting buildings!  Nice work with basic, too.', '2008-02-12 16:10:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4483209, 639993, 67697, '<td valign="top">What an amazing thing to see the difference between the two photos.  I bet your photo history of this work is something to see.  My favorite part of this is seeing the blue sky being reflected in the windows.  I bet this building is going to be gorgeous when the restoration is complete.</td>', 'What an amazing thing to see the difference between the two photos.  I bet your photo history of this work is something to see.  My favorite part of this is seeing the blue sky being reflected in the windows.  I bet this building is going to be gorgeous when the restoration is complete.', '2008-02-13 11:31:24.000000', NULL, 0),
