(4533908, 639574, 60862, '<td valign="top">An interesting choice for this challenge.  The score probably reflects the lack of focus on the actual architecture, but I think it''s a great image beyond the challenge.  Definitely has an artistic feel to it.</td>', 'An interesting choice for this challenge.  The score probably reflects the lack of focus on the actual architecture, but I think it''s a great image beyond the challenge.  Definitely has an artistic feel to it.', '2008-03-03 00:03:04.000000', NULL, 0),
