(4533924, 639988, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the juxtaposition, but the contrast is quite low.  I''d also suggest either a larger aperture so the tree blurs out quite a bit or a smaller aperture so the arch is sharper.  Probably the former.</td>', 'I like the juxtaposition, but the contrast is quite low.  I''d also suggest either a larger aperture so the tree blurs out quite a bit or a smaller aperture so the arch is sharper.  Probably the former.', '2008-03-03 00:06:26.000000', NULL, 0),
