(4535258, 639993, 65319, '<td valign="top">The blue reflections of the sky in the windows add to the beauty of this fabulous old building!  However disappointing though the score may be, the weight of it''s historical significance will carry through as part of a series as your documentary of this building unfolds.  I can''t wait to see the condos!  ;-)</td>', 'The blue reflections of the sky in the windows add to the beauty of this fabulous old building!  However disappointing though the score may be, the weight of it''s historical significance will carry through as part of a series as your documentary of this building unfolds.  I can''t wait to see the condos!  ;-)', '2008-03-03 12:47:48.000000', NULL, 0),
