(4549949, 639881, 51538, '<td valign="top">Used to be the university with the highest suicide rate in the UK.  A dubious claim to fame.  From this stark concrete in-the-green-and-pleasant-land architecture on display in your photo, I can understand why.  It''s austere and you captured it.</td>', 'Used to be the university with the highest suicide rate in the UK.  A dubious claim to fame.  From this stark concrete in-the-green-and-pleasant-land architecture on display in your photo, I can understand why.  It''s austere and you captured it.', '2008-03-09 12:40:01.000000', NULL, 0),
