(4604418, 639477, 39427, '<td valign="top">yeah man, have to agree with the commenters below, def way over-saturated, as shown in the bright blues in the steps where there should not be any bright blues.  with less color, or even black and white, i think this picture would have been a 6+, but did not deserve a 4.32.  composition and framing is great, so is the light, processing just threw people off.  And its a bit grainy, could use some neat image too!</td>', 'yeah man, have to agree with the commenters below, def way over-saturated, as shown in the bright blues in the steps where there should not be any bright blues.  with less color, or even black and white, i think this picture would have been a 6+, but did not deserve a 4.32.  composition and framing is great, so is the light, processing just threw people off.  And its a bit grainy, could use some neat image too!', '2008-04-02 00:53:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4610390, 637413, 19944, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely beautiful shot.  Nice lighting, really crisp.<br/> <br/>I haven''t been to the Basilica since I was a kid and I went on a CCD field trip.  Now you have me wanting to go back.<br/> <br/>It''s amazing how little you visit the things that are in your own back yard.  I actually worked about a block and half from the basilica for about two years.  I went to the library across the street a couple times, but never here.</td>', 'This is an absolutely beautiful shot.  Nice lighting, really crisp. I haven''t been to the Basilica since I was a kid and I went on a CCD field trip.  Now you have me wanting to go back. It''s amazing how little you visit the things that are in your own back yard.  I actually worked about a block and half from the basilica for about two years.  I went to the library across the street a couple times, but never here.', '2008-04-03 10:50:29.000000', NULL, 0),
