(4673283, 639471, 73452, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture, i wish we had some cool abandoned buildings around here to photograph.  Not many ''round here.  I love this picture though, the wide angle gives the building great stature and size.  and I love the sepia. very well done</td>', 'beautiful picture, i wish we had some cool abandoned buildings around here to photograph.  Not many ''round here.  I love this picture though, the wide angle gives the building great stature and size.  and I love the sepia. very well done', '2008-05-01 23:46:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4685329, 639891, 67697, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I missed commenting on your new PB photo! A belated congrats to you.<br/> <br/>Very cool photo.  I love the little gleams of light coming from the blue and green ring.  Someone described it as looking futuristic and I''d have to say it''s quite true.  Very cool catch.</td>', 'I can''t believe I missed commenting on your new PB photo! A belated congrats to you. Very cool photo.  I love the little gleams of light coming from the blue and green ring.  Someone described it as looking futuristic and I''d have to say it''s quite true.  Very cool catch.', '2008-05-06 22:13:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4706846, 638699, 42013, '<td valign="top">I never faved this? Now I have. :)</td>', 'I never faved this? Now I have. :)', '2008-05-16 14:43:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4778599, 637875, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like what you were going for here, but the not-quite-vertical orientation throws off the symmetry. Focus is a little soft too.</td>', 'I like what you were going for here, but the not-quite-vertical orientation throws off the symmetry. Focus is a little soft too.', '2008-06-20 22:39:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4790475, 639957, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice. I did some similar shots to this at the Alamo, but I was unhappy with any of my own of this scene. It was about the time I joined DPC, and I''ve learned a lot since then. I ought to have at those images again.</td>', 'Nice. I did some similar shots to this at the Alamo, but I was unhappy with any of my own of this scene. It was about the time I joined DPC, and I''ve learned a lot since then. I ought to have at those images again.', '2008-06-29 21:39:06.000000', NULL, 0),
