(4811002, 638126, 69008, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of "blue and old" !   I like the reflection of the older building in the new one in this shot.  Looking down the comments, I see that this has been said already.  I noticed the overall sharp focus, and see that you were shooting at f22. That was a good choice to get all the elements in focus.</td>', 'Nice contrast of "blue and old" !   I like the reflection of the older building in the new one in this shot.  Looking down the comments, I see that this has been said already.  I noticed the overall sharp focus, and see that you were shooting at f22. That was a good choice to get all the elements in focus.', '2008-07-08 01:30:32.000000', NULL, 0),
